flowchart LR
  Global[Global Jarvis Memory] --> Recall[Jarvis Recall]
  Business[Business Memory] --> Recall
  Agent[Agent Memory] --> Recall
  Task[Task Memory] --> Recall
  Run[Run Memory] --> Recall

  Recall --> Context[Context Pack]
  Context --> LLM[Agent / LLM Execution]
  LLM --> NewMemory[New Memory Candidate]
  NewMemory --> Review{Needs Review?}
  Review -- Yes --> Approval[Memory Review]
  Review -- No --> Store[Store by Scope]
